<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verdis Blockchain | The World's First Green Blockchain</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Verdis is a world-class Layer-1 green blockchain ecosystem engineered with Rust and Substrate. Powered by WASM smart contracts, BABE/GRANDPA consensus, native AMM DEX, and on-chain carbon credit tracking.">
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/verdis.css?v=3">
    <script src="/js/verdis.js?v=3"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>

    <style>
        .hero-canvas-container { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.55; }
        .hero-inner-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
        .hero-pills-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; margin-top: 32px; }
        .hero-pill-badge { background: rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.25); color: var(--accent); padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.02em; backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
        .live-stats-banner { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-accent); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: var(--space-xl); margin-top: -60px; position: relative; z-index: 10; box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow); }
        .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(440px, 1fr)); gap: 32px; }
        .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
        .grid-4 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
        .feature-icon-box { width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--gradient-accent-soft); border: 1px solid var(--border-accent); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 26px; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .tech-card-item { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 32px; transition: var(--transition-slow); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .tech-card-item:hover { border-color: var(--accent); transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow); }
        .arch-flow-box { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px; }
        .arch-flow-node { background: var(--bg-input); border: 1px solid var(--border-light); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .faq-accordion-wrap { max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .faq-accordion-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); margin-bottom: 16px; overflow: hidden; transition: var(--transition); }
        .faq-accordion-card.active { border-color: var(--accent); box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow); }
        .faq-accordion-head { padding: 22px 28px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; color: var(--text-primary); }
        .faq-accordion-head:hover { color: var(--accent); }
        .faq-accordion-body { padding: 0 28px 24px 28px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8; display: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 18px; font-size: 15px; }
        .faq-accordion-card.active .faq-accordion-body { display: block; }
        .faq-toggle-icon { font-size: 20px; color: var(--accent); transition: transform 0.3s ease; }
        .faq-accordion-card.active .faq-toggle-icon { transform: rotate(45deg); }
        .timeline-wrapper { position: relative; padding-left: 40px; border-left: 2px solid var(--border-light); margin-top: 40px; }
        .timeline-step { position: relative; margin-bottom: 48px; }
        .timeline-step::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: -49px; top: 4px; width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--border-light); border: 3px solid var(--bg-primary); }
        .timeline-step.completed::before { background: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--accent); }
        .timeline-step.active::before { background: var(--info); box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--info); }
        .code-box-styled { background: #060a07; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 24px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; color: #a3e6c2; overflow-x: auto; line-height: 1.7; position: relative; }
        .calc-card-styled { background: var(--bg-card-hover); border: 1px solid var(--border-accent); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 36px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow); }
        .table-responsive-container { overflow-x: auto; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border); margin-top: 24px; }
        .status-badge-green { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(0,255,136,0.15); color: var(--accent); }
    </style>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon-32.png" sizes="32x32"/>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon-16.png" sizes="16x16"/>
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/favicon-192.png"/>
<link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest"/>
</head>
<body>
<!-- Verdis V Logo Splash -->
<div class="verdis-splash-overlay" id="verdis-splash">
  <div class="verdis-splash-logo">
    <svg class="verdis-anim-logo" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:120px;height:120px">
      <path class="hex-path" d="M20 3L34 11V27L20 35L6 27V11L20 3Z" stroke="#00ff88" stroke-width="2" fill="rgba(0,255,136,0.03)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path class="v-path" d="M13 13L20 27M27 13L20 27" stroke="#00ff88" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path class="leaf-accent" d="M20 18C17 18 15 20 15 23C15 26 17 28 20 28C23 28 25 26 25 23C25 20 23 18 20 18Z" fill="#00ff88" opacity="0.3"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="verdis-splash-text">VERDIS</div>
  <div class="verdis-splash-spinner"></div>
</div>
<!-- End Verdis Splash -->


<div id="verdis-nav"></div>


<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-canvas-container">
        <canvas id="particle-canvas" style="width:100%; height:100%;"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-inner-content reveal">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Enterprise Green Layer-1 Blockchain Protocol</span>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
            The World's First <br>
            <span class="hero-title-accent">Green Blockchain Ecosystem</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">
            Verdis is a world-class Layer-1 blockchain platform engineered with Rust and Substrate. Built with deterministic BABE block production, GRANDPA finality, high-throughput WASM smart contracts, native AMM DEX liquidity, and verifiably carbon-negative on-chain ledger accounting.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="/wallet/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Launch Web Wallet</a>
            <a href="/explorer/" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Explore Blockchain</a>
            <a href="/token-sale/" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Token Presale</a>
            <a href="/whitepaper/" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">Technical Whitepaper</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-pills-row">
            <span class="hero-pill-badge">&#9889; Native Coin Ticker: VRDX</span>
            <span class="hero-pill-badge">&#128274; Max Supply: 100,000,000,000 VRDX</span>
            <span class="hero-pill-badge">&#129302; Rust + Substrate Engine</span>
            <span class="hero-pill-badge">&#128268; WASM Smart Contracts (pallet-contracts)</span>
            <span class="hero-pill-badge">&#127811; Green DPoS Consensus</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="live-stats-banner reveal" id="live-stats">
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:20px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px;">
            <div>
                <h3 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:700;">Live Blockchain Telemetry & Status</h3>
                <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary);">Real-time JSON-RPC telemetry fetched from <code>https://rpc.verdischain.com</code></p>
            </div>
            <div class="status-badge-green">
                <span style="width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--accent); display:inline-block;"></span>
                10-Node Testnet Cluster Active
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-grid">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-label">Block Height</div>
                <div class="stat-value stat-accent" id="stat-block">#1,842,910</div>
                <div class="stat-sub">Live via Substrate RPC</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-label">Active Peers</div>
                <div class="stat-value" id="stat-peers">10</div>
                <div class="stat-sub">10-Node Testnet Topology</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-label">Extrinsics Processed</div>
                <div class="stat-value" id="stat-txs">TBD</div>
                <div class="stat-sub">On-Chain State Transitions</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-label">Consensus Protocol</div>
                <div class="stat-value" style="font-size:20px;">BABE / GRANDPA</div>
                <div class="stat-sub">Block Production + Finality</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-label">Max Coin Supply</div>
                <div class="stat-value" style="font-size:20px;">100B VRDX</div>
                <div class="stat-sub">Fixed Hard Cap</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section class="section" id="what-is-verdis">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Next-Generation Distributed Ledger</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">What is Verdis?</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
            Verdis is an enterprise-grade Layer-1 blockchain engineered to reconcile cryptographic security, sub-second transaction speed, and verified environmental sustainability.
        </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="tech-card-item reveal">
            <div class="feature-icon-box">&#127811;</div>
            <h3 style="font-size:22px; margin-bottom:12px;">Carbon-Negative Core</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
                Verdis operates under Green Delegated Proof of Stake (DPoS), replacing energy-heavy mining hardware with lightweight validator nodes. Protocol pallets natively log carbon credits, timber reforestation projects, and validator sustainability scores directly on the ledger.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card-item reveal">
            <div class="feature-icon-box">&#9881;</div>
            <h3 style="font-size:22px; margin-bottom:12px;">Rust & Polkadot SDK</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
                Architected on the Substrate framework (Polkadot SDK), Verdis offers type-safe memory safety in Rust, forkless runtime upgrades via WASM proposals, and composable custom pallets for financial primitives.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card-item reveal">
            <div class="feature-icon-box">&#9889;</div>
            <h3 style="font-size:22px; margin-bottom:12px;">WASM Smart Contracts</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
                Developers deploy compiled WebAssembly (WASM) smart contracts using <code>pallet-contracts</code> and the ink! domain-specific language, enjoying hardware-level performance and sandboxed safety guarantees.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DETAILED COMPARISON TABLE -->
    <div class="card-glass reveal" style="margin-top:48px;">
        <h3 style="font-size:22px; color:var(--accent); margin-bottom:16px;">Architectural Comparison Matrix</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom:20px;">
            How Verdis compares against legacy Proof-of-Work and traditional Proof-of-Stake networks:
        </p>
        <div class="table-responsive-container">
            <table class="verdis-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Architectural Dimension</th>
                        <th>Verdis (VRDX)</th>
                        <th>Proof-of-Work (Bitcoin)</th>
                        <th>Traditional PoS (EVM)</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Consensus Mechanism</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-success">BABE / GRANDPA (Green DPoS)</span></td>
                        <td>Proof-of-Work (SHA-256)</td>
                        <td>Gasper / Tendermint</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Environmental Footprint</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-success">Verifiably Carbon-Negative</span></td>
                        <td>Extremely High Energy Consumption</td>
                        <td>Carbon Neutral (Unverified Off-Chain)</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Smart Contract Runtime</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-success">WebAssembly (pallet-contracts)</span></td>
                        <td>Scripting / None</td>
                        <td>EVM Bytecode Interpreter</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Protocol Upgrades</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-success">Forkless On-Chain WASM Proposals</span></td>
                        <td>Hard Fork Required</td>
                        <td>Hard Fork Required</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Native Eco-Tracking</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-success">Native Reforestation & Carbon Pallets</span></td>
                        <td>Not Available</td>
                        <td>Not Available</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Native Financial Suite</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-success">Native AMM DEX, NFTs, Multisig</span></td>
                        <td>Not Available</td>
                        <td>Requires 3rd-Party Contracts</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Max Supply Cap</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-info">100,000,000,000 VRDX</span></td>
                        <td>21,000,000 BTC</td>
                        <td>Variable / Inflationary</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="why-verdis">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">The Verdis Advantage</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Why Build on Verdis?</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
            Engineered for sovereign carbon accounting, green finance (ReFi), institutional compliance, and high-speed Web3 applications.
        </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="card-glass reveal">
            <h3 style="font-size:24px; color:var(--accent); margin-bottom:16px;">Verifiable Environmental Provenance</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:16px;">
                Traditional blockchains claim sustainability through external unverified offsets. Verdis embeds carbon tracking directly into state transition functions.
            </p>
            <ul style="list-style:none; padding:0; line-height:2.2; color:var(--text-primary);">
                <li>&#10003; <strong>On-Chain Reforestation Logging:</strong> Geo-tagged registry of verified planting sites.</li>
                <li>&#10003; <strong>Carbon Credit Minting:</strong> Direct tokenization and retirement of audited greenhouse gas credits.</li>
                <li>&#10003; <strong>Green Validator Scoring:</strong> Staking multipliers tied to renewable energy node telemetry.</li>
                <li>&#10003; <strong>Automated ESG Auditing:</strong> Standardized JSON-RPC data feeds for corporate sustainability reports.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card-glass reveal">
            <h3 style="font-size:24px; color:var(--accent); margin-bottom:16px;">Enterprise Financial Suite</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:16px;">
                Verdis ships with full-stack financial primitives built directly into the Substrate runtime layer.
            </p>
            <ul style="list-style:none; padding:0; line-height:2.2; color:var(--text-primary);">
                <li>&#10003; <strong>Native AMM DEX:</strong> Constant-product liquidity pools ($x \cdot y = k$) for instant asset swaps.</li>
                <li>&#10003; <strong>Native Eco-NFT Standard:</strong> Digital assets backed by physical conservation plots.</li>
                <li>&#10003; <strong>Threshold Multisig:</strong> M-of-N multi-signature account logic for enterprise treasuries.</li>
                <li>&#10003; <strong>On-Chain Governance:</strong> Democracy referenda, elected council, and treasury spend proposals.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Consensus Mechanism</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">How Verdis Works</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
            Combining BABE slot-based block production with GRANDPA finality under a Delegated Proof-of-Stake model.
        </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="tech-card-item reveal">
            <div class="badge badge-success" style="margin-bottom:16px;">Step 1</div>
            <h3 style="font-size:20px; margin-bottom:10px;">BABE Block Authoring</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px; line-height:1.7;">
                Blind Assignment for Blockchain Extension divides time into discrete slots. Active validators run Verifiable Random Functions (VRF) to evaluate slot leadership without leaking future block author identities.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card-item reveal">
            <div class="badge badge-info" style="margin-bottom:16px;">Step 2</div>
            <h3 style="font-size:20px; margin-bottom:10px;">GRANDPA Finality Engine</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px; line-height:1.7;">
                GHOST-based Recursive Ancestor Deriving Prefix Agreement operates asynchronously alongside BABE. Validators vote on chain prefixes, finalizing hundreds of blocks simultaneously with mathematical certainty.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card-item reveal">
            <div class="badge badge-warning" style="margin-bottom:16px;">Step 3</div>
            <h3 style="font-size:20px; margin-bottom:10px;">Green DPoS & Slashing</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px; line-height:1.7;">
                VRDX holders delegate stake to top validators. Nodes that commit equivocation (double-signing) or fail green uptime criteria face immediate, automated protocol slashing of validator and nominator collateral.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="architecture">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Protocol Stack</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Substrate Architecture</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
            Modular, extensible, and secure runtime architecture engineered in Rust.
        </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="card-glass reveal">
        <div class="arch-flow-box">
            <div class="arch-flow-node">
                <div>
                    <strong style="color:var(--accent); font-size:16px;">1. Client & Application Layer</strong>
                    <div style="font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin-top:4px;">
                        Verdis Web Explorer, Web Wallet, AMM DEX UI, Developer SDKs, and JSON-RPC API (<code>https://rpc.verdischain.com</code>).
                    </div>
                </div>
                <span class="badge badge-neutral">Client API</span>
            </div>
            
            <div class="arch-flow-node">
                <div>
                    <strong style="color:var(--accent); font-size:16px;">2. WebAssembly Execution Engine (WASM)</strong>
                    <div style="font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin-top:4px;">
                        <code>pallet-contracts</code> engine executing ink! compiled WASM smart contracts with strict memory sandboxing and gas metering.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <span class="badge badge-success">Smart Contracts</span>
            </div>
            
            <div class="arch-flow-node">
                <div>
                    <strong style="color:var(--accent); font-size:16px;">3. Substrate State Transition Function (STF) Pallets</strong>
                    <div style="font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin-top:4px;">
                        System, Balances, Staking, Democracy, Council, Treasury, Multisig, Eco-Tracking, and AMM Liquidity Pallets.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <span class="badge badge-info">Runtime Core</span>
            </div>
            
            <div class="arch-flow-node">
                <div>
                    <strong style="color:var(--accent); font-size:16px;">4. Consensus & Networking Infrastructure</strong>
                    <div style="font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin-top:4px;">
                        BABE VRF Block Production, GRANDPA Finality voting rounds, Merkle-Patricia State Trie DB, and libp2p encrypted P2P networking.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <span class="badge badge-warning">Node Core</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="technology">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Native Features</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Ecosystem Technology</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
            All core financial and eco primitives are built directly into the Substrate runtime state machine.
        </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="tech-card-item reveal">
            <h4 style="color:var(--accent); font-size:18px; margin-bottom:8px;">Native AMM DEX</h4>
            <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.6;">
                Automated Market Maker pallet supporting constant-product liquidity pools, automated yield routing, and eco-fee rebates.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card-item reveal">
            <h4 style="color:var(--accent); font-size:18px; margin-bottom:8px;">Eco-NFT Standard</h4>
            <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.6;">
                Mint non-fungible tokens directly linked to physical reforestation plots, carbon offset certificates, and clean energy assets.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card-item reveal">
            <h4 style="color:var(--accent); font-size:18px; margin-bottom:8px;">Fungible Token Pallet</h4>
            <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.6;">
                Issue custom tokens with defined supply caps, minting logic, freeze permissions, and burn schedules at the STF layer.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card-item reveal">
            <h4 style="color:var(--accent); font-size:18px; margin-bottom:8px;">Threshold Multisig</h4>
            <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.6;">
                M-of-N multi-signature account logic allowing enterprise treasuries and DAO councils to manage assets with time-locked approvals.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card-item reveal">
            <h4 style="color:var(--accent); font-size:18px; margin-bottom:8px;">On-Chain Governance</h4>
            <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.6;">
                Public proposal submissions, weighted conviction voting, elected council oversight, and automated treasury spend execution.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card-item reveal">
            <h4 style="color:var(--accent); font-size:18px; margin-bottom:8px;">Eco-Tracking Engine</h4>
            <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.6;">
                On-chain carbon offset auditing, timber logging verification, and automated green score calculations for active validators.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="security">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Cryptographic Protection</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Network Security</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
            Engineered with strict mathematical guarantees, memory safety in Rust, and robust consensus slashing.
        </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="card reveal">
            <h4 style="font-size:20px; color:var(--accent); margin-bottom:12px;">DPoS Economic Slashing</h4>
            <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
                Validators must deposit significant VRDX economic stake. Any detected double-signing (equivocation), block withholding, or unannounced node downtime during assigned BABE slots results in automated protocol slashing of validator and nominator collateral.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
            <h4 style="font-size:20px; color:var(--accent); margin-bottom:12px;">Schnorrkel Sr25519 Signatures</h4>
            <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
                Verdis implements Schnorrkel sr25519 signature schemes over Ristretto255 curve groups for key derivation and VRF evaluations, alongside ed25519 and ecdsa support for hardware wallet signers.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

